# "base" kernel fragment: Sidero's kernel config + only what these boards need to work.
# Appended to siderolabs/pkgs kernel/build/config-arm64, then `make olddefconfig`.
# Used for the regular images only when the Talos release's kernel lacks it (1.14 series);
# the media flavor is this fragment + kernel/media.config.
#
# Ethernet PHY on Quartz64 A and SOQuartz (Motorcomm YT8511/YT8511C). Without it Linux
# binds "Generic PHY", the PHY's 125 MHz RGMII clock is never set up, and the link is up
# but passes no traffic. Built in (=y), not =m: as a module, Generic PHY binds first.
CONFIG_MOTORCOMM_PHY=y
